('127.30.d.5.G',4,'Genetically modified crops are debated because:','["no one grows them", "they are illegal everywhere", "people weigh benefits against environmental and health concerns", "all agree on them"]'::jsonb,2,'Public discussion includes many viewpoints.','original'),
('127.30.d.6.A',2,'FFA is a student organization that develops:','["only cooking skills", "only sports skills", "only video skills", "leadership, personal growth and career success"]'::jsonb,3,'FFA stands for premier leadership development.','original'),
